<title>UK: EIB adds 8.7 bln pesetas to March 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 8.7 bln pesetas to March 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following six-tranche bond has been increased by 8.7 billion pesetas, lead manager Banco Santander de Negocios said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT ** 43.5 BLN PTA  COUPON   * NONE	MATURITY    **</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** SIX EQUAL TRANCHES OF 7.25 BLN PTA (ORIGINALLY 5.8</p>
<p>		BLN PTA) MATURING ON 24.MAR.00, 27.MAR.00,</p>
<p>		28.MAR.00, 29.MAR.00, 30.MAR.00 AND 31.MAR.00.</p>
<p>	    * REDEMPTION AT PAR PLUS 94.252874 PCT OF THE INCREASE</p>
<p>		IN THE IBEX-35 INDEX.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED SEPTEMBER 16</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
